Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish. If you want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing. No time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marks maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to the mountain without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are about to get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even for him, this is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was over in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd hoped it would take long\Nenough for him to sober up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! My house! My house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Third gear! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.48,0:05:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to stop Kaido right\Nnow, so I can't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Elephant Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Something knocked him out of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the guy who took out a rash man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,General Hold 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:06:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I remain unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:06:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I feared I'd lost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That fear is unfounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin Castle! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Master Keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Without him, it's all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I must ensure his safety,\Nno matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there is someone else\Nyou should be worrying about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsuru
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo could wake up and continue\Nhis rampage at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The townspeople are still in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A fine point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall go to Okobore town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I shall leave the young\Nlord in your capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You survived that somehow. Right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,General Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are serious injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she left town earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so too, but I just saw\Nher fall from the commander's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed, say something, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Porcelina!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, General Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing\Nhere in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Tama?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you got her back home safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,On our way back, we were\Nspotted by Commander Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried my best to fight, but\NI couldn't protect her. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.36,0:09:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going, Speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I received a very\Ntroubling report about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have left her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:10:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have protected her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We should run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a lucky shot back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And Kaido's so big he\Nprobably didn't notice you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late to get\Nthe hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.64,0:11:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido got to Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinemon's friends and both of our crews.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know if they're alive
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I kick his ass\Nnow, it's over, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come fight me Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who's going to\Nbe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Last breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So at last, you've come\Nto the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You just couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as you get here,\Nyou screw everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to tell you that\NI'll never forget this big
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,brew because I've never had\Nsuch good food in my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAUGH!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll set you flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying. Kido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,HONKAM!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,FRIZLY!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,MAGNUS!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,4th gear! Bounce man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to finish this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've screwed up this country enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've messed\Nwith my friends, it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kong Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kong Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.14,0:19:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.28,0:20:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kum-Kum!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Double-tubbering!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.28,0:20:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What? What? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom, Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom Morgan, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.82,0:22:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's a monster, but who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.44,0:22:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.16,0:23:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.10,0:23:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thundermar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.60,0:24:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That useless idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.32,0:24:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.18,0:24:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.22,0:24:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.06,0:24:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if this is a show\Nof will or simply bravado,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but that little bastard's glaring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.06,0:24:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Glaring?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.97,0:24:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got good eyes, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.68,0:25:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks knocked out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.20,0:25:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that you said about being king?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.18,0:25:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing.
